Subject: [PATCH 13/77] arm64: boot: dts: qcom: add OnePlus 7/Pro/T

Add initial device trees for the OnePlus 7, 7T and 7 Pro.

simplefb seems to work on all devices. Dies before init.

Signed-off-by: Caleb Connolly <caleb@connolly.tech>
